meta {
  name: 07 explain the sentence on its own
  type: http
  seq: 7
}

post {
  url: {{host}}/_nl
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

body:json {
  {
    "prompt": "how many products are out of stock",
    "response": "explain"
  }
}

docs {
  What you get back - explain, the sentence on its own

  "response": "explain" drops "result" and leaves the sentence. Good when the answer goes straight to a person and nothing is going to read the data.
}
